<title>INDIA: TISCO Q1 97/98 steel sales at 554,000 T.</title>
<headline>TISCO Q1 97/98 steel sales at 554,000 T.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>India's Tata Iron and Steel Company Ltd (TISCO) said on Thursday it had sold 554,000 tonnes of steel during the first quarter of financial year 1997/98 (April-March).</p>
<p>TISCO chairman Ratan Tata made the announcement at the company's annual general meeting.</p>
<p>&quot;The firm's exports during the first quarter were $42 million,&quot; he added.</p>
<p>Further details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom +91-22-265 9000</p>
